{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the first few hours of \u201cBakery Cafe Simulator\u201d solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/4ed442a9eee52d9c4882f5caf04517be8ce17b2d.jpg"},{"name":"Just out of the oven!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/9ec4936d6736d207ad4ec7044118a46acb20dca4.jpg"},{"name":"Would you like another slice?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/c5796fe5799d0677a4e1f968d06041e140393bc2.jpg"},{"name":"Tough work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/4569fb7e39a959df95275c3e58befa83cf247813.jpg"},{"name":"It's the business that comes in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/0a293f5ce3d3b567f9ee72fba6a61982a457e34a.jpg"},{"name":"Want some vitamins?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669720/e645a4ec044c79ba03b1c1a40e8aa89c325a8a7d.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"http